## Tagline
"Before buying new, discover what your campus can reuse."

## Problem
College events repeatedly require materials such as display boards, banners, stands, signboards, decorations, and props. Useful materials can remain undiscovered or be discarded because departments lack a shared inventory, reliable reservation process, condition history, and reuse tracking.

## Solution
ReLoop Campus is a verified campus reuse platform for discovering, reserving, handing over, returning, repairing, and tracking event materials.

